[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490034215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4490034215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4490034215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC6B8Jw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T16:50:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T16:52:49Z","body":"Does it say anywhere that this is meant to work? AFAIK the editor has been updated to use the new asset store so it won't be able to handle the old I'd assume\n\nMaybe this needs to be documented in that case but I'd say it'd be expected that it won't work ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490034215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490138243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4490138243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4490138243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC6ISgw","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T17:04:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T17:04:03Z","body":"It seems really inconvenient for users to have to get all of their old favorite assets from the website rather than inside the engine. I imagine many users will also be confused when trying to download an asset they had used previously from inside the editor","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490138243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490144493","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4490144493","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4490144493,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC6Iq7Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T17:04:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T17:06:06Z","body":"Absolutely, but it means maintaining two parallel interfaces and APIs (assuming this is not a bug) so it's a lot of extra work for an older feature\n\nGiven that the setting uses the wording \"asset store\" both in the path and the text means it's implied at least pretty directly that it doesn't support the asset library","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490144493/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490161326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4490161326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4490161326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC6Jsrg","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T17:07:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T17:07:13Z","body":"The old one doesn't have to be maintained, it could be in the drop down with the note \"[unsupported]\" as a prefix\n\nI think many users would just think it's a rebranding","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490161326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490179041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4490179041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4490179041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC6Kx4Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T17:09:32Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T17:09:32Z","body":"I don't think most users think it's just a rebranding given that it has new features, and I don't expect most users to be confused here\n\n> The old one doesn't have to be maintained\n\nThat won't be possible, if we put something in the editor it needs to be maintained, we can't put dead code in the editor, especially if it's a feature that's demanded (if it isn't, then we shouldn't add it)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4490179041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492413626","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4492413626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4492413626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC8TKug","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T22:01:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T22:01:47Z","body":"If you use assets that aren't on the asset store yet, I suggest you open issues to ask the authors to upload them to the asset store on the asset's repository.\n\nIf the author is inactive, you can upload the asset yourself to the asset store while making sure to respect the original license and attribution information (make sure to credit the original author in the README and asset description).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492413626/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492483076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4492483076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4492483076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC8XaBA","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T22:11:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T22:11:31Z","body":"I'm partially confused as to why the old asset lib isn't compatible with the new asset store. Are the APIs different enough to where the editor can't use the old site as an asset host?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492483076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492534454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4492534454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4492534454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC8aitg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T22:19:06Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T22:19:06Z","body":"> I'm partially confused as to why the old asset lib isn't compatible with the new asset store. Are the APIs different enough to where the editor can't use the old site as an asset host?\n\nThe APIs returned by the asset library and store are completely different, since the asset store aims to support multiple asset versions, reviews and much more. It's not realistically feasible to adapt the old asset library to follow the new asset store API, since we don't have anyone available to work on it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492534454/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492617924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4492617924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4492617924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC8foxA","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T22:31:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T22:31:38Z","body":"Not sure if the option is there for someone outside the main team, but if it is, I could have a look and see how feasible updating it is for me to take on the task?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492617924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4529514686","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4529514686","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4529514686,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDfrovg","user":{"login":"TheDuckCow","id":2958461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTg0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2958461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuckCow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuckCow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-24T17:45:22Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T17:45:22Z","body":"Not saying this is part of the intention of the foundation, and seeing it this way may be a little heavy-handed, but here's my perspective on why we _shouldn't_ support the old library:\n\nThere's a much stronger incentive to migrate to the new store as soon as possible if the old library isn't available. This means we'll get back to a stronger stable ecosystem _sooner_ with the new platform, which means a better user experience for everyone _sooner_ on the unified store and all the benefits that has (ratings, reviews, confidence of what actually works) etc. It also means _users_ of those tools will do more nudging to authors of legacy assets, which I'm sure will lead to many more projects shifted over _sooner_, which again is better in the long haul. There will definitely be projects where the original author wouldn't do anything unless someone bothers them about it. And if they don't respond to this pressure, then [per above](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4492413626), it's a good signal to fork the abandoned project anyways (as allowable).\n\nIf a legacy link were provided, and can be used to install assets as-is, there will be much less incentive for developer to rush to the new platform - especially for tools not actively maintained yet \"still working\". I'm saying this as an addon developer for Blender who is actively maintaining several \"legacy addons\" instead of using their new extension system, largely because the legacy addon structure still works fine with new Blender versions (not truly an analogous scenario - there's additional reasons not to in my case, and with the Godot store there's no intrinsic implications about backwards compatibility, but you get the idea).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4529514686/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4530405834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119578#issuecomment-4530405834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119578","id":4530405834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDgiByg","user":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h